## System Prompts and Configuration

### The Architect System Prompt
The system uses a sophisticated **266-line system prompt** ([`frontend/lib/system-prompt.ts`](frontend/lib/system-prompt.ts:1)) that enforces:

#### Phase Control Protocol
1. **ANALYSIS_MODE**: Upon file upload - analyze without generating SOW
2. **DRAFTING_MODE**: After user confirmation - generate full SOW

#### Core Knowledge Base
- **OFFICIAL_RATE_CARD**: 96 roles with exact hourly rates (AUD)
- **FINANCIAL_RULES**: Mandatory calculation order (hours × rate → discount → GST)
- **JSON_STRUCTURE**: Required format for all pricing blocks
- **ROLE_MAPPING**: Specific deliverable-to-role mapping rules

#### Critical Failure Conditions
- Using any role/rate not in OFFICIAL_RATE_CARD = automatic failure
- Incorrect mathematical calculations = automatic failure
- Missing mandatory governance roles = automatic failure

### Rate Card System
Authoritative rate card with **96 official roles** ([`frontend/lib/rateCard.ts`](frontend/lib/rateCard.ts:1)):

#### Role Categories
- **Account Management**: Senior Account Director ($365/hr) to Account Coordinator ($120/hr)
- **Project Management**: Head Of Senior Project Management ($365/hr) to Project Coordination ($110/hr)
- **Tech Delivery**: Sr. Architect roles ($365/hr) to Producer roles ($120/hr)
- **Content**: Strategy roles ($210/hr) to Copywriting ($120-$180/hr)
- **Design**: Digital Asset roles ($140-$190/hr)

#### Pricing Rules
- **Mandatory Roles**: Project Management + Account Management always included
- **Role Diversity**: 5-10+ roles per project based on scope
- **Budget Calibration**: Hours scaled to match budget constraints
- **GST Calculation**: 10% on subtotal after discount

